Subject: [PATCH 2/2] feat: Remove an Event with its enrollments when forced

With a valid confirmation code and force=1 (checkbox on the confirmation page), Event::safeDestroy(force: true) deletes the enrollments and then the Event in a single transaction. Without force the current refusal stays. The flash tells how many enrollments were removed.
